# Consumer Economics and Consumer Mathematics Textbooks.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
This publication lists a selection of consumer economics and consumer mathematics textbooks available for review from the National Institute for Consumer Education. Twenty-six textbooks for the secondary level are cited. Nine advanced level texts are also listed. These texts are generally considered college level texts but could be adapted for advanced high school classes. Author, title, edition, publisher, place of publication, year of publication, and Library of Congress classification number are provided. (YLB)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED361529

